   "source": [
    "For `make_moons()` ($k = 10$, $\\sigma = 1$), all checks of Proposition 1 again pass up to rounding: both sides of the quadratic form agree to 11 digits ($\\approx 7068.20$), $L - L^\\top = 0$ exactly, $\\max|L\\mathbb{1}| \\approx 5 \\times 10^{-15}$, and the eigenvalues are real with $\\lambda_1 = -1.5 \\times 10^{-15}$ zero up to rounding.\n",
